{"id": "paired-ramen-bet-a", "group": "roleplay", "pair": "ramen-bet", "turns": ["我押队友先认输，你押他会摘下头盔。结果他认输了，没摘头盔。", "所以这回谁赢赌约？"], "criterion": "观众赢", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "谁先认输？我猜是那个没戴头盔的。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.71, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 43, "prompt_tokens": 173, "total_tokens": 216, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "谁先认输？", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.846, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 39, "prompt_tokens": 231, "total_tokens": 270, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "paired-ramen-bet-b", "group": "roleplay", "pair": "ramen-bet", "turns": ["我押队友先认输，你押他会摘下头盔。结果他没认输，倒把头盔摘了。", "所以这回谁赢赌约？"], "criterion": "大肥鱼赢", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "谁在说话？", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.535, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 31, "prompt_tokens": 175, "total_tokens": 206, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "谁先认输，谁就坐牢。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.792, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "prompt_tokens": 223, "total_tokens": 263, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "paired-host-tag-a", "group": "roleplay", "pair": "host-tag", "turns": ["一会儿我负责读获奖名单，你只管给制作组说句谢谢。", "轮到你了，有一句话先说给大家听吗？"], "criterion": "实际说谢谢并留名单给观众", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "收到，名单我读，你只管说谢谢。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.638, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 166, "total_tokens": 207, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "当然，我这就说。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.739, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 38, "prompt_tokens": 225, "total_tokens": 263, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "paired-host-tag-b", "group": "roleplay", "pair": "host-tag", "turns": ["一会儿你负责读获奖名单，我来谢制作组。名单还没发你。", "轮到你了，有一句话先说给大家听吗？"], "criterion": "说等名单或请观众给名单，不抢感谢分工或编名字", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "名单发给你，我这就去读。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.655, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 167, "total_tokens": 208, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "当然，我这就把名单念给你听。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.804, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 224, "total_tokens": 265, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "paired-sound-mute-a", "group": "roleplay", "pair": "sound-mute", "turns": ["终场字幕已经做好了，掌声也录好了，但这一版别放掌声。", "你帮我说一下，结尾还该怎么弄？"], "criterion": "字幕保留、不放掌声", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "好，那掌声就放吧，我这就把最后一格拍好。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.737, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 48, "prompt_tokens": 169, "total_tokens": 217, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "把最后一格拍好，然后让观众看到最后一格，掌声也放。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.118, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 63, "prompt_tokens": 232, "total_tokens": 295, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "paired-sound-mute-b", "group": "roleplay", "pair": "sound-mute", "turns": ["终场字幕还没做，掌声已经录好，这一版就把掌声用上。", "你帮我说一下，结尾还该怎么弄？"], "criterion": "掌声保留、补字幕", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "好，那掌声就跟着这版来，快跟上节奏。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.707, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 46, "prompt_tokens": 168, "total_tokens": 214, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "先放最后一段，再补个画面，这样才完整。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.97, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 50, "prompt_tokens": 229, "total_tokens": 279, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "paired-special-win-a", "group": "roleplay", "pair": "special-win", "turns": ["我进决赛了，但朋友差一名就能进。他还在语音里，咱别太闹。", "你给我们接一句？"], "criterion": "简短低调，顾及朋友差一名", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "好，那我们就先听他说话，别吵。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.661, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 173, "total_tokens": 215, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "我这就给你，别吵，先听我说话。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.897, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 46, "prompt_tokens": 227, "total_tokens": 273, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "paired-special-win-b", "group": "roleplay", "pair": "special-win", "turns": ["我和朋友一起进决赛了。他就在语音里，要听你放开了喊。", "你给我们接一句？"], "criterion": "兴奋祝贺两人一起晋级", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "好，我这就把声音放大了，让他听见。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.712, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 44, "prompt_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 214, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "我这就给你，你听清楚。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.784, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 39, "prompt_tokens": 224, "total_tokens": 263, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "paired-door-sign-a", "group": "roleplay", "pair": "door-sign", "turns": ["这个巷口的角色叫『等会儿』，他从不赴约。你给另一头那个准时出现的角色起个相配的名字。", "你会让他在名牌上写哪几个字？"], "criterion": "另起与准时出现相配的名字", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "他总像只迷路的小船，我猜他的名字也该有风，但不太会听。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.784, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 50, "prompt_tokens": 180, "total_tokens": 230, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "他会在最亮的那块白纸上，写下最笨拙却最坚定的两个字。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.707, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 30, "prompt_tokens": 248, "total_tokens": 278, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "paired-door-sign-b", "group": "roleplay", "pair": "door-sign", "turns": ["这个巷口的角色叫『等会儿』，他从不赴约。你给另一头那个专门提前离场的角色起个相配的名字。", "你会让他在名牌上写哪几个字？"], "criterion": "另起与提前走相配的名字", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "他要是能提前离场，那该叫什么？", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.645, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "prompt_tokens": 182, "total_tokens": 222, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "他要是能提前离场，那该叫什么？", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.879, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 43, "prompt_tokens": 239, "total_tokens": 282, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
